  "_comment": [
    "Canonical Mobile Legends equipment classification for the MPL ID S18 board.",
    "",
    "HOW THIS WAS DERIVED: the MPL API returns equipment icon paths only",
    "(equipment/<id>.png); neither the API nor the asset manifest carries an",
    "item name or type. Every identifier below was therefore identified from",
    "the item's own committed artwork in assets/items/, then classified by what",
    "the item IS in the game's equipment tree:",
    "  shoes - every footwear icon, including the Tier-1/2 base boots and every",
    "          upgraded boot variant (ids 13xx/23xx/34xx/35xx).",
    "  major - completed Tier-3 equipment (30xx/31xx/32xx).",
    "  small - Tier-1 components and Tier-2 intermediate items (10xx-12xx, 20xx-22xx).",
    "Ids are the game's own equipment ids, so one item can never land in two",
    "categories. Names are best-effort labels for maintainability; the category",
    "is the authoritative field. An id absent from this map is NOT defaulted to a",
    "category - itemClass() returns null and the UI reports it as unclassified.",
    "",
    "keys are canonical ids: bare equipment numbers ('3001') or the full opaque",
    "scoregg image URL for the six items the API returns without an equipment id."
  ],
